PROPOSAL: product-direction decision for the maintainer; do not implement without a go-ahead.

Evidence: anchors: "Über Größe" gives "ber-gr-e", "日本語 🚀" gives "", duplicates get no suffix (Parser.pm:229-231). content_preview/char_count include the heading line while get_paragraph's content excludes it.
Options: (a) GitHub-style Unicode slug with -1/-2 suffixes; (b) leave anchors; for preview/char_count: (c) body-only values, (d) document as is (done in the skill/POD).
Recommendation: (a) + (d); anchors are part of get_toc's wire form, so announce in Changes.

2026-10-26 19:51 Decision (coordinator, on the maintainer's order to work the board off): options (a) + (d): GitHub-style Unicode anchors with -1/-2 suffixes; preview/char_count stay as documented. Branch kopf.

Done in 422cc31. Decision: spec'd slug exactly (no collapsing of hyphens, trailing hyphen kept, e.g. '日本語 🚀' -> '日本語-'); repeat suffix avoids already-used anchors.
